observer (0.14.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * The "Text size" selector is now "Zoom" and also goes below 100 %: 75
    and 85 % join 100, 115, 130 and 150. Below 100 the window shows more
    without scrolling (more history rows and, in the default 900x700
    window, one more column of gauges) at the price of smaller text. 75 is
    the floor, measured on real captures: buttons go from 32 to 24 px tall
    and the status ring keeps its hole. An older dashboard reading a
    preferences file with 0.75 or 0.85 opens at 100 % in silence, keeps
    window and theme, and writes 100 % back on close.

